# skills: a boss refuses fear but takes poison. Gabryel alone at level 26 (level index 25 pinned, battle
# MP pinned to 50) in the Sasquatch fight (event battle 1, forced from Delrich Temple as
# test_skill_knockout_boss.plan does): Sasquatch (a boss row) is battler 9 between two Yetis (8, 10).
# Howl (Down, Right, Right on the list), grid Right to Sasquatch, A: refused with "No effect!" (shot
# bv_refused), no MP taken. B back to the commands; Venom Claw (Right on the list), Right to Sasquatch, A:
# cast (bv_00 to bv_23), MP 50 -> 42, status9 0 -> 6.
# The random state is set to 24 as each effect starts (roll 3), under the boss's 80% for poison and blind.
# Battle records at 0x0228E860 (0x6C each: status in the low nibble of +0x08, HP +0x14, MP +0x18, ATK +0x24, ATK stage +0x40). Run with --save.
include boot_from_save
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 2
pin u16 0x020B4650 65535
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u16 0x020B77EC 6
press Right 40
press Down,Right 40
press Right 40
press Down 80
wait 200
unpin
pin u16 0x020B4724 999
pin u16 0x020B4720 999
pin u16 0x020B464C 2
pin u16 0x020B4650 65535
pin u16 0x020B4654 65535
pin u32 0x020B471C 25
pinptr u32 0x020B8620 0x18 50
execpoke 0x020503A0 u32 0x020A0238 24
wait 30
poke u16 0x020B7838 1
poke u16 0x020B783A 1
poke u32 0x020B0010 0x73
waituntil u32 0x020B0010 7 3000
wait 120
battlers
peek u32 0x020B8620 records
watch u32 0x0228e878 gabryel_mp
watch u8 0x0228ebc8 status8
watch u8 0x0228ec34 status9
watch u8 0x0228eca0 status10
press A 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press A 8
wait 60
press Down 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
press Right 8
wait 50
shot bv_howl
press A 8
wait 70
press Right 8
wait 20
press A 8
wait 30
shot bv_refused
wait 80
press B 8
wait 80
shot bv_back
